# Shopsys Project Structure Guide

This is a monorepo for the Shopsys e-commerce platform with clear separation between backend and frontend.

## Main Directories

- **Backend (PHP/Symfony)**: [project-base/](mdc:project-base/) - The main PHP application
    - [project-base/src/](mdc:project-base/src/) - Application source code
    - [project-base/config/](mdc:project-base/config/) - Symfony configuration
    - [project-base/tests/](mdc:project-base/tests/) - Backend tests
    - [project-base/app/](mdc:project-base/app/) - Application configuration and resources

- **Frontend (React/Next.js)**: [project-base/storefront/](mdc:project-base/storefront/) - The Next.js storefront
    - [project-base/storefront/components/](mdc:project-base/storefront/components/) - React components
    - [project-base/storefront/graphql/](mdc:project-base/storefront/graphql/) - GraphQL queries and generated types
    - [project-base/storefront/pages/](mdc:project-base/storefront/pages/) - Next.js pages
    - [project-base/storefront/styles/](mdc:project-base/storefront/styles/) - Stylesheets and Tailwind CSS
    - [project-base/storefront/utils/](mdc:project-base/storefront/utils/) - Utility functions
    - [project-base/storefront/types/](mdc:project-base/storefront/types/) - TypeScript type definitions

- **Packages**: [packages/](mdc:packages/) - Reusable packages and bundles
    - [packages/framework/](mdc:packages/framework/) - Core Shopsys framework
    - [packages/frontend-api/](mdc:packages/frontend-api/) - GraphQL API for frontend
    - [packages/coding-standards/](mdc:packages/coding-standards/) - Code style rules

- **Documentation**: [docs/](mdc:docs/) - Project documentation

## Key Configuration Files

- [project-base/composer.json](mdc:project-base/composer.json) - PHP dependencies
- [project-base/storefront/package.json](mdc:project-base/storefront/package.json) - Node.js dependencies
- [docker-compose.yml](mdc:docker-compose.yml) - Docker services configuration
- [Makefile](mdc:Makefile) - Common development commands

## Entry Points

- Backend: [project-base/src/](mdc:project-base/src/) contains the main application code
- Frontend: [project-base/storefront/pages/](mdc:project-base/storefront/pages/) contains Next.js pages
- API: GraphQL schema is generated at [project-base/app/schema.graphql](mdc:project-base/app/schema.graphql)
